["transition","LNGHZN-S10-T2",1786754244,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d~4",{"to":"done","outcome":"Added make check-fast (scripts/check-fast.sh) implementing D2 diff-routing (go/skills/census/docs-fallback surfaces, reverse importers via go list, BASE= override) and D3 single-run coverage in the full gate (coverage runs suite once with -coverprofile, coverage-check reads the profile). Added scripts/test-check-fast.sh with routing assertions (positive + negative per surface). Updated docs/agents/quality-gates.md. make check passed clean (85.8% coverage, single test run). Demonstrated check-fast on a docs-only change (routed to adr-principles only) and a Go change (routed to build+lint+test across changed pkg plus 8 reverse importers, caught a real goimports issue). PR: https://github.com/scullxbones/armature/pull/104. Skipped delivery gate solely for gitignored build artifacts (bin/, coverage.out, coverage.html, mutesting-report/, scripts/__pycache__/) produced by the required make check run; git status --short showed a clean tracked tree.","skipped_delivery_gate":true}]
